   "id": "lead-1",
   "section": "(lead)",
   "text": "Vincent Montgomery Rue is an American psychotherapist and advocate for the view that abortion can negatively impact women's mental health, as well as the founder and co-director (along with his wife, Susan Stanford-Rue, who is also a psychotherapist) of the now-inactive Institute for Pregnancy Loss.",
